1205.description:
The Horsemen of the Apocalypse don't always bring disaster. For example, in Darksiders: Wrath of War, a Horseman of the famous Four is the chosen one, tasked with restoring balance and punishing the demons who broke the pact with the angels. This time, you'll take on the role of the most powerful Horseman, named "War," who has been summoned to stabilize the situation after all humanity perished. The demons have broken free and are now wreaking havoc. The angels, who were unexpectedly attacked, can stop them. Now War will set things right and put an end to the war that has erupted and promises to last for eternity. He will use his upgradeable combat skills, his faithful steed, and the enormous Soul Sword.

Game features:
- rejoice, as the visual style, atmosphere and storyline for the game are created by Joe Mudureyer himself, known for his iconic work in the X-Men, The Ultimates and Battle Chasers games;
- thanks to modern technology, the game Darksiders Warmastered Edition It looks great, it perfectly creates the atmosphere of the apocalypse, preserves the atmosphere of war, has excellent level design and first-class special effects;
- Darksiders 1 Wrath of War is an open-world slasher, which is so rare in our time, you will be able to explore the most hidden corners of the game universe, look for secrets and collect pieces of the story of what is happening;
- War is not just a warrior, he is the most skilled fighter of the four and now his fury will fall on the demons, he knows no regret, knows no obstacles and is an excellent master of martial arts using a huge sword, now the demons will know all the fury of the chosen one;
- War knows how to handle not only his huge sword, as the game progresses you will find a lot of new weapons, and if they seem ineffective to you, then nothing stops you from using the environment, for example, lampposts;
- do not forget that you are a horseman of the apocalypse and your main ability is to absorb the souls of the fallen, which can make you much stronger, more agile and tougher;
- and if the situation turns out to be hopeless, then there is no need to worry, because you can call on your faithful horse named Ruina and he will definitely pull you out of any situation.

Installation:
1. Download the folder anywhere (make sure the folder path has Latin characters only).
2. Run "darksiders1.exe".

